flowchart LR
    Browser[React dashboard] -->|HTTP /api| Gateway[API Gateway]
    Gateway -->|service ID lookup| Eureka[Discovery Service / Eureka]
    Gateway -->|lb://product-service| Product[Product Service]
    Product --> ProductDB[(Product MySQL database)]
    Product -. future events .-> Kafka[(Apache Kafka)]
    Auth[Auth Service - scaffold] -. future identity .-> Gateway
    Inventory[Inventory Service - scaffold] -. future events .-> Kafka
    Supplier[Supplier Service - scaffold]
    Purchase[Purchase Service - scaffold]
    Sales[Sales Service - scaffold]
    Notification[Notification Service - scaffold] -. future events .-> Kafka
    Reporting[Reporting Service - scaffold] -. future events .-> Kafka
